Molmo2 single-image pointing adapter
-----------------------------------

Upstream: Allen Institute for AI (Ai2), https://github.com/allenai/molmo2
Commit: f3cb1085fbb97c4a4d7fdcadd77cf871bf37a88a
License: Apache-2.0 (full text: licenses/Apache-2.0.txt in LibreYOLO)

The adapter and parser integrate the upstream Hugging Face usage API and the
point grammar documented in olmo/preprocessing/point_formatter.py and its tests.
LibreYOLO reuses its existing VLM inference and point-result implementations;
no Molmo2 architecture source is bundled in this Python package.
Remote model/processor code and weights originate from these Apache-2.0
snapshots, with unmodified learned parameters:

allenai/Molmo2-4B   @ 042abfa7a38879a376cec03d949eff0aefaa0600
allenai/Molmo2-8B   @ e28fa28597e5ec5e0cca2201dd8ab33d48bc4a1b
allenai/Molmo2-O-7B @ 784410650d12be9bc086118fdefa32d2c3bced86

4B/8B use Qwen3 language backbones; O-7B uses OLMo 3. The released snapshots
include the SigLIP vision backbone and their tokenizer assets. Upstream model
cards declare Apache-2.0 for all three snapshots.

Qwen3-VL-Embedding adapter (instruction format and last-token pooling)
------------------------------------------------------------------

Upstream: Tongyi Lab, Alibaba Group, https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL-Embedding
Commit: 393e2978d27852b0d0230d6994f37f9c15bed73c
Reference file: scripts/qwen3_vl_embedding.py in Qwen/Qwen3-VL-Embedding-2B
(Hugging Face revision 9f2f7e710d6d81056aa5c0a4f04764fec6bb7bda)
License: Apache-2.0 (full text: licenses/Apache-2.0.txt in LibreYOLO)

libreyolo/models/vlm/qwen3vl_embedding.py adapts the reference embedder's
input conventions: the system-instruction chat layout with the default
instruction "Represent the user's input.", the trailing-punctuation rule for
instructions, the image pixel budget (4,096 to 1,843,200 pixels on a 32-pixel
grid), and last-non-padding-token pooling with right padding. The Qwen3-VL
architecture runs from transformers; no model source is copied. Weights are
the Apache-2.0 Qwen/Qwen3-VL-Embedding-2B snapshot with unmodified learned
parameters.
